// error: `v` is used before it's assigned
// error: `m` is used before it's assigned
// error: `k` is used before it's assigned
// error: `&` marks a call's argument passed `inout` or `set`, and is only used there
// error: cannot call `p.scale`, which takes `inout self`, on `p`, which is immutable
